 5   300   3   5      12                                      0

Reading: K > J => 0 mismatches (degenerate); K <= J => the violation set really
depends on K.  On N the far-left jump D1 is unbounded, so EVERY finite K sits in
the non-degenerate regime there: the infinite question has content, every finite
board does not.
